<gpx version="1.1" creator="SkipperCast" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><metadata><name>SC26-081-C habitat research</name></metadata><wpt lat="35.416191" lon="-120.973368"><name>SC26-081-C</name><desc>Point Estero rough reef Mapped rough-rock high; 6.1 m relief across 210 m. Terrain C 37/100; not catch probability. Center 173 ft; nearby 166–189 ft MLLW. Survey-derived habitat candidate; no verified catch at this coordinate. No verified charter identity match in the reviewed AIS sample; no AIS-confirmed hotspot. Survey 2008; screen 2026-09-20. No additional flag from this depth and closure screening. Check current regulations, closures, conditions and sounder depths.</desc><link href="https://doi.org/10.5066/P9ZSTUK1"/><sym>Fishing Area</sym></wpt><trk><name>SC-AREA-063</name><desc>Partial nearby mapped rough-rock/bedrock footprint, clipped within 350 m of retained targets and by depth/closure screening; not the complete reef or an individual pile.</desc><trkseg><trkpt lat="35.41931560859641" lon="-120.97422545344818"/><trkpt lat="35.41923103825843" lon="-120.9745579584305"/><trkpt lat="35.41787936320572" lon="-120.97459180155536"/><trkpt lat="35.417423263845954" lon="-120.97427284111487"/><trkpt lat="35.417051732722705" lon="-120.97362138808177"/><trkpt lat="35.416691286153146" lon="-120.97363041658082"/><trkpt lat="35.416336382079635" lon="-120.97396968131395"/><trkpt lat="35.41597593538957" lon="-120.97397870802357"/><trkpt lat="35.4159833239144" lon="-120.97441902139781"/><trkpt lat="35.415712988808025" lon="-120.97442578985597"/><trkpt lat="35.41544080674425" lon="-120.97432248059988"/><trkpt lat="35.41552352964263" lon="-120.97387991347868"/><trkpt lat="35.41524765200572" lon="-120.97355645166489"/><trkpt lat="35.41550689897046" lon="-120.97288921457098"/><trkpt lat="35.41577538545676" lon="-120.97277236305845"/><trkpt lat="35.41613583188946" lon="-120.97276333104317"/><trkpt lat="35.41614137677825" lon="-120.97309356646264"/><trkpt lat="35.416411711